# Bunker 1 (Severnaya). Objectives (tools/bot/objectives.py assets/obseg/setup/UsetupsevbunkerZ.c):
#   0 disrupt all surveillance equipment (CCTV tags 0-3; SA+)
#   1 copy the GoldenEye key (the key analyser used while the key - tag 4 - is held; all)
#   2/3 00 only (flags 0x100 / 0x400)
#   4 photograph the main video screen (all): the bot photographs from a tile with a line to it and centres the
#     screen's box (port_playerbot.c photoSpot / photoAim)
# The mission ends when Bond walks into the room of pad 100 (ai_16) with every objective done: the way out.
name bunker1
obj=0 auto
obj=1 collect obj 4
obj=1 equip keyanalysercase
obj=1 press z 4
obj=1 wait 60
obj=4 auto
auto
goto pad 100 80
exit
